---
title: "add_rule (Sui Framework: transfer_policy)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_owner: assert object::id(policy) == cap.policy_id
    q_check_owner --> q_abort_owner: IDs don't match
    q_abort_owner --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_owner --> q_check_exists: owner verified
    q_check_exists --> q_abort_exists: has_rule(policy)
    q_abort_exists --> [*]: abort ERuleAlreadySet
    q_check_exists --> q_add: rule not yet set
    q_add --> q_add_config: df::add(RuleKey, cfg)
    q_add_config --> q_insert_rule: policy.rules.insert(type_name(Rule))
    q_insert_rule --> [*]: rule added to policy

    note right of q_check_exists
        INV-001: only policy cap owner can add rules
        INV-002: each rule type can only be added once
        INV-003: Config stored per Rule type (not per action)
        INV-004: Config requires store + drop for removability
    end note
